  "title": "Zucchini-Feta Casserole",
  "description": "Try this addictive bulgur wheat-based casserole, made with zucchini, eggs, and feta cheese. It's a perfect vegetarian main or side dish.",
  "authors": [
    "MBauer"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-04T00:15:38-04:00",
